  <h2 class="card-title" style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #0f172a;">404 - Page Not Found</h2>
  <p class="card-subtitle" style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto; font-size: 1rem;">
